          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rising tempo of maritime incidents elevates geopolitical risk and disrupts trade corridors, triggering immediate safe‑haven capital flows and dollar funding demand that push the key currency higher versus peers." />
