          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Publicized and repeated use of remotely piloted or semi‑autonomous strike systems raises demonstrable risks of weaponized autonomy, prompting near‑term regulators to impose export controls, certification requirements, and usage bans on dual‑use AI capabilities." />
