          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An uptick in armed drone employment and combat-proven tactics in Ukraine accelerates transfers, sales, and tactical adoption by state and proxy actors in the Middle East, increasing the frequency of drone-enabled strikes, near-misses, and harassment of vessels in the Strait of Hormuz." />
